7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Rhou4pBQXvlPdw6YAP0VRw","review_id":"rxDYUWyz9VY8SUSi7oWjPg","date":"2017-06-11T22:22:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9301812648773193,"text_excerpt":"Uptown New Orleans needed a good salad place! I had the salmon salad and it was great because it had so many different things in it. The dressing was delicious but not too heavy. They were a little slow in getting the food out. The salad was a little pricey but was very enjoyable. You can pick up to go or eat there. The space is very clean and new. Parking is on the street but during the week there wasn't a problem finding a spot."},{"business_id":"Rhou4pBQXvlPdw6YAP0VRw","review_id":"cDu3IVQBBhhaMXmh2ccAtA","date":"2017-08-30T16:58:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9199129939079285,"text_excerpt":"Y'all this place has my absolute favorite salad in all of New Orleans- the Salmon Avocado salad with Wild Alaskan salmon, mixed greens, kelp noodles, avocado, cherry tomatoes, cucumber, edamame, fig, roasted almonds, carrots, crunchy noodle things, and lemon miso dressing. WOW. I could eat this salad every day. Highlights of the salad: the seasoning on the salmon is so tasty; the carrots seem to maybe be a little pickled which makes them 1000x better; the crunchy noodle things are such a nice crunchy component; there is a mix of kale, arugula, and romaine which is awesome; and the dressing is bomb. Everything just works so perfectly together, and I seriously get sad when I finish eating i..."},{"business_id":"Rhou4pBQXvlPdw6YAP0VRw","review_id":"Y6Fy8LWDC1FEHj7htu4s2w","date":"2017-04-21T21:58:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9148389101028442,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. Ordered the Asian chicken salad and subbed chicken for tofu. It was delicious. Can't wait to go back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Rhou4pBQXvlPdw6YAP0VRw","photo_id":"zTYyORiVYjQacLt7BOXPYw","label":"inside","image_url":"/ph